a73517b512953b8a.avif?t=1754908477\" width=800 height=109 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Narrative &amp; Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Your words and actions steer both lives toward sweet, spicy, or bittersweet finales.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Daily Sandbox</strong> \u2013 Choose how to spend limited time: cooking, gifting, exploring tight rooms, or triggering NSFW encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relationship Progression</strong> \u2013 Earn Riley\u2019s trust to unlock new dialogue, private scenes, and daring options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scene Gallery</strong> \u2013 Replay any unlocked moment whenever you wish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collectibles &amp; Easter Eggs</strong> \u2013 Find non-canon art pieces that brighten your bunker walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-Language Support</strong> \u2013 \u00a0Enjoy machine-assisted localisations beyond English.</p></li></ul>",
